{
  "_note": "世界时钟 42(2–4 城市)。行几何由 clock.df 按入参 n 给。生成器 gen_moment_clock.py。",
  "rc": {
    "cells": [
      {
        "id": "bg",
        "type": "layer",
        "x": "0pt",
        "y": "0pt",
        "w": "{parent.w}",
        "h": "{parent.h}",
        "bgColor": "linear(#FFFFFF\\,#FBFBFE\\,#F5F5FC)@90|linear(#15171A\\,#181A1F\\,#1D1F28)@90"
      },
      {
        "id": "dot",
        "type": "layer",
        "x": "14.0pt",
        "y": "{hd.y}+({hd.h}-5pt)/2",
        "w": "5pt",
        "h": "5pt",
        "cornerRadius": {
          "leftT": "2.5pt",
          "leftB": "2.5pt",
          "rightT": "2.5pt",
          "rightB": "2.5pt"
        },
        "bgColor": "#5B5BD6|#A5A3FF"
      },
      {
        "id": "hd",
        "type": "txt",
        "x": "23.0pt",
        "y": "12pt",
        "w": "180pt",
        "h": "-1",
        "maxLines": "1",
        "text": "${@i18n.ttl}",
        "fontSize": "13pt",
        "typeface": "System-Bold",
        "textColor": "#0E1116|#F3F4F6"
      },
      {
        "id": "at",
        "type": "txt",
        "x": "{parent.w}-124pt",
        "y": "15pt",
        "w": "110pt",
        "h": "-1",
        "maxLines": "1",
        "alignmentH": "2",
        "text": "${@i18n.local} $[findNotEmpty::(${lt},--:--)]",
        "fontSize": "9pt",
        "textColor": "#6B7280|#8E939B",
        "_note": "时效锚 = 这张卡算出来时的本地时间。桌面小组件并不每分钟重画(免费档 5 分钟、iOS 桌面约 15 分钟),拿它和状态栏的钟一比,就知道卡上的时间是几分钟前的。"
      },
      {
        "type": "op",
        "action": "if",
        "props": {
          "val": "$[if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${nn},__none__),__none__),0,1)]"
        },
        "react": [
          {
            "type": "op",
            "action": "if",
            "props": {
              "val": "$[if::(gt::(${nn},0),1,0)]"
            },
            "react": [
              {
                "id": "r0",
                "type": "layer",
                "x": "14.0pt",
                "y": "${ry0}pt",
                "w": "{parent.w}-28pt",
                "h": "${rh}pt",
                "bgColor": "#E7E9EE|#20232A",
                "cornerRadius": {
                  "leftT": "9pt",
                  "leftB": "9pt",
                  "rightT": "9pt",
                  "rightB": "9pt"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "ic0a",
                "type": "layer",
                "x": "24.0pt",
                "y": "{r0.y}+({r0.h}-9pt)/2",
                "w": "9pt",
                "h": "9pt",
                "cornerRadius": {
                  "leftT": "4.5pt",
                  "leftB": "4.5pt",
                  "rightT": "4.5pt",
                  "rightB": "4.5pt"
                },
                "bgColor": "$[if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${ng0},0),1),#7C7FD9|#A5A3FF,#F59E0B|#F2B655)]",
                "hide": "$[if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${ng0},__none__),__none__),1,0)]",
                "_note": "没数据不画(空态里一颗琥珀圆点会被读成「白天」)。"
              },
              {
                "id": "ic0b",
                "type": "layer",
                "x": "{ic0a.x}+3.4pt",
                "y": "{ic0a.y}-1.6pt",
                "w": "7.2pt",
                "h": "7.2pt",
                "cornerRadius": {
                  "leftT": "3.6pt",
                  "leftB": "3.6pt",
                  "rightT": "3.6pt",
                  "rightB": "3.6pt"
                },
                "bgColor": "#E7E9EE|#20232A",
                "hide": "$[if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${ng0},__none__),1),0,1)]"
              },
              {
                "id": "nm0",
                "type": "txt",
                "x": "40.0pt",
                "y": "{r0.y}+({r0.h}-{nm0.h})/2",
                "w": "104pt",
                "h": "-1",
                "maxLines": "1",
                "lineBreak": "0",
                "text": "$[findNotEmpty::(${n0},--)]",
                "fontSize": "${fN}pt",
                "typeface": "System-Bold",
                "textColor": "#0E1116|#F3F4F6"
              },
              {
                "id": "sb0",
                "type": "txt",
                "x": "146.0pt",
